codex
The endpoint now uses an exhaustive status decision: created shipments are copied and saved as confirmed, confirmed shipments are returned unchanged, cancelled shipments use the existing centralized 409 envelope, and missing IDs use the existing 404 path. I’ve added integration coverage for persistence and all three edge cases.
